{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1000_p", "source_sha256": "727a4335948eaa73ea79995c88ed9c4bbddd3c771c627f0f1ca04244d1083e91", "ja": "お疲れさまです、青羽さん。\n社長と音無さん、たった今到着しましたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，青羽小姐。\n社长和音无小姐刚刚到了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "094d4b2e08dcba5145139ef6cad30cfc53681a27b406f4753dcbdde3e72c73d3", "ja": "お疲れさま、美咲ちゃん。公演が待ちきれないのね？\n楽しそうな声が、廊下にも聞こえてきたわ。", "zh": "辛苦了，美咲。已经等不及演出了吧？\n我在走廊都听到你那开心的声音了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "0794c1dc5c4422ef42815a240b405425db8a5bbe0aca361f1aeb5695316e5fda", "ja": "はい！　お芝居のあらすじを読んでいたら、\nつい自分のことを重ねてしまって……えへへ。", "zh": "是的！读着话剧的剧情简介时，不知不觉就联想到自己了……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1003_president", "source_sha256": "1d7430620d7cc53f3f17db1bb8168148abebc301330e5f7171bb08b6e222dbbf", "ja": "今回は、いわゆる文化系の青春劇……。青羽君も、\n服飾にかける熱い想いがあるだろうからね！", "zh": "这次是所谓的文化系青春剧……毕竟青羽对服饰也有着一腔热爱嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "fa08ed1d736ea7e2b069cf90f27e43f12fb98be932ba06ce945a5f41bb6b6f4d", "ja": "私も、スポーツよりは文系ですね。いろいろなものを\n見たり読んだりしては、想像して……ウフフ♪", "zh": "我也是，比起体育更偏文科。会看看、读读各种东西，然后展开想象……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1005_president", "source_sha256": "554035071f3b3bd3c4c8aa0ac016e1c1733ddeea59f8c841e4883a82c0a125b9", "ja": "ふむ……。我々はバンドも経験したことだし、今度は\n創作活動をやってみるのも、アリかもしれないね！", "zh": "嗯……我们也体验过组乐队了，接下来试试创作活动，说不定也不错呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1006_102mis", "source_sha256": "377a00fc24a6129b9da318ac006cdd14cfd30d9c37d63c81f6bdc1cf83cdb906", "ja": "私たちで、サークルを組むんですか？　素敵ですね！\nお裁縫なら任せてください！", "zh": "我们来组个社团吗？太棒了！\n裁缝方面就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1007_p", "source_sha256": "ad3c58519eb98b6300a9f07af9dd66a24519aad00da44965a2204c962142a3ab", "ja": "自分にできる事なら、お手伝いします。\nそういえば音無さんも、マンガとかお好きでしたよね。", "zh": "只要是我能做到的事，我会帮忙的。说起来，音无小姐也喜欢漫画之类的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "c8bf179d2d81b9c5f0896216adc2e1e2062e436c58c0af7bccbb4ab1c4ac3587", "ja": "だったら、私が衣装を仕立てて、音無先輩と\n{$P$}さんに着てもらうとか！", "zh": "那我可以来裁制服装，让音无前辈和{$P$}先生穿上呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9323012ca6d185e79daa6a6d41eb0dd408db59088d193ea6e6b5f9f55446c523", "ja": "えっ……衣装を？\nた、確かに、手伝うとは言いましたが……。", "zh": "诶……做服装？\n我、我确实说过会帮忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1010_101kot", "source_sha256": "dad8bbd66d3a5457c0bba88749f609bd691ca35c975abfff9a9a39989a30e513", "ja": "美咲ちゃんの衣装を、{$P$}さんと\n私が！？　も、妄想が現実に……！", "zh": "美咲的服装，要由{$P$}先生和我来做！？妄想成真了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "cbc7a8d007e7ad86dafd62eededac33ff09229dfa00b3578dd873f07e7f3f8f1", "ja": "だめっ、だめよ小鳥っ！\n……美咲ちゃん、やっぱりそれは遠慮しておくわ！", "zh": "不行，不行啊，小鸟！\n……美咲，我还是谢绝了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1012_102mis", "source_sha256": "dc5f4c2d148c5b91a565852368c056e7824f10989c6a550b1339908a6f798d03", "ja": "えっ、どうしてですか？", "zh": "咦，为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1013_101kot", "source_sha256": "b5b36cb3a90903c179f27c5b7def52a6232eef4b41c53c4ae79358b4f46a834e", "ja": "気持ちは嬉しいけど、これは趣味の活動ですもの。\n美咲ちゃんには、自分の好きな服を作って欲しいわ。", "zh": "你的心意我很高兴，不过这毕竟是兴趣活动嘛。\n我希望美咲能做自己喜欢的衣服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1014_101kot", "source_sha256": "e439d2a9265fdf04e3c3083d53f15a999af62e03d95251d98817921dd4cbe48d", "ja": "それに、私は輝いているみんなを\n見守っている方が、性に合っているもの♪", "zh": "而且，比起亲自闪耀，我更适合守望着大家闪耀的模样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1015_102mis", "source_sha256": "1cc1edf0b9d7d7e632d7da85426d7de904bb260e0fc5b19211008e6db2d03d83", "ja": "音無先輩……わかりました！　それじゃあ私は、\n私の道をとことん追求してみたいと思います！", "zh": "音无前辈……我明白了！那么，我想彻底追寻属于自己的道路！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1016_president", "source_sha256": "52b69412f900e1843aa506cfb7f975ddcfe30889b99171de1f535816385b62cb", "ja": "うむ！　自分のためではなく、誰かの創作を見守る。\nこれもまた、ひとつの愛の形かもしれないね。", "zh": "嗯！　并非为了自己，而是守护着某人的创作。\n这或许，也是一种爱的形式呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1017_p", "source_sha256": "c1f1ba734b40ff9ce9e09bab828c36ab2504f217d816465016c785dc4d5c8dec", "ja": "そうですね。……あっ、そろそろ時間ですね。\n会場の方へ急ぎましょう。", "zh": "是啊。……啊，差不多到时间了。\n我们赶紧去会场吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "9614fad793c281fd986706c10618d94128e88cdf2f48efd5791549c6ef8143f4", "ja": "お待たせいたしました。これより\n『LOVERS HEART』ゲネプロ上演となります。", "zh": "让您久等了。接下来将进行\n《LOVERS HEART》的彩排演出。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0231_story_intro_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0231_story_intro_1019_102mis", "source_sha256": "ea27f3d37c5d0bb062f09eadc2382083b9864ed5720652b99a0bf790ec4fe623", "ja": "765プロがお届けする、溢れんばかりの大きな愛。\nどうか届きますように……♪", "zh": "由765事务所为您献上，满溢而出的浩瀚之爱。\n愿这份爱意能够传达给各位……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
